elated","section_type":"normalPoster"},{"data":[{"items":[],"id":12814,"title":"","description":"0","card_type":"comments","type":"comments","url":"","style":null,"length":0,"continue_watching_progress":0}],"id":0,"title":"Comments","section_type":"comments"}],"post_info":{"genres":["Thriller"],"id":12814,"type":"MOVIE","title":"Achamindri","logo":"","image":"https://cdn6.albox.co/storage/disk47/shows/c545abee-7c7e-4730-9010-4b8941c73dd1.jpg","background_image":"https://cdn6.albox.co/storage/disk44/shows/fb96ff5d-ec96-46b2-9c17-2708cdba4646.jpg","likes":5,"dislikes":2,"views":4906,"release_date":"1483056000000","length":7048,"description":"The film begins with an honest education department official (Thalaivasal Vijay) dying in a bomb blast. Then, we are introduced to Sakthi (Vijay Vasanth), a pickpocket, who is attracted towards Malarvizhi (Srushti Dange), a middle-class girl. There is also Sathya (Samuthirakani), a straightforward cop, who is about to get married to his childhood sweetheart Shruti (Vidya Pradeep). Their lives turn topsy-turvy on the same day - Sakthi is chased by goons for picking the pocket of a gangster; Malar is threatened by the education minister's PA (Jayakumar) for filing for re-evaluation on behalf of her maid's daughter; and Sathya is attacked by his own friend and cop Saravanan (Bharat Reddy) as he starts digging into the death of Shruti.","rating":{"sources":[{"title":"IMDb","logo":"https://a7.pnghunt.com/preview/450/662/555/computer-wallpaper-text-brand-yellow-imdb.jpg","max_value":10,"value":7.8}],"value":7.8,"age":"PG-13"},"episode_id":12814,"content_control":"FAMILY"}}